.TH TRANSLATE 1 "2026-03-17" "toolbox" "Toolbox Commands"

.SH NAME
translate \- translate text using Google Cloud Translation

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B translate
.RB [ \-s
.IR SOURCE ]
.RB [ \-t
.IR TARGET ]
.IR TEXT

.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B translate
command translates text using the Google Cloud Translation API.

Authentication is performed using the environment variable
.BR GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS .

The default source language is controlled by
.BR GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_SOURCE_LANG ,
falling back to
.B auto
when unset.

The default target language is controlled by
.BR GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_TARGET_LANG ,
falling back to
.B en
when unset.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-s LANG
Source language code.

.TP
.B \-t LANG
Target language code.

.TP
.B \-h
Display help information.

.SH EXAMPLES

Translate English text to Portuguese:

.EX
translate -s en -t pt "hello world"
.EE

Translate Portuguese text to English:

.EX
translate -s pt -t en "olá mundo"
.EE

Translate Russian text to English:

.EX
translate -s ru -t en "Привет мир"
.EE

.SH ENVIRONMENT

.TP
.B GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS
Path to the Google Cloud service account JSON file.

.TP
.B GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_SOURCE_LANG
Default source language.

.TP
.B GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_TARGET_LANG
Default target language.

.SH AUTHOR
Thiago Ribeiro
